BT /F1 10 Tf 54 612 Td (- For one feature, linear regression predicts y_hat = w*x + b; for multiple features, y_hat = Xw) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 597 Td (+ b.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 580 Td (- Mean squared error is the mean of \(prediction - target\) squared and penalizes large errors) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 565 Td (strongly.) Tj ET
