BT /F2 12 Tf 54 509 Td (Gradient descent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 488 Td (- For MSE with n examples, gradient for w is \(2/n\) times X-transpose multiplied by prediction) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 473 Td (error; gradient for b is \(2/n\) times the sum of errors.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 456 Td (- Update each parameter by subtracting learning_rate times its gradient.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 439 Td (- A learning rate that is too high can diverge; one that is too low converges slowly.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 54 400 Td (Practical workflow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 379 Td (- Standardize features when scales differ greatly to make gradient descent better conditioned.) Tj ET
