BT /F2 12 Tf 54 306 Td (Evaluation and assumptions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 285 Td (- MAE is the mean absolute error; RMSE is the square root of MSE and remains in target units.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 268 Td (- R-squared compares model error with predicting the target mean; it is not proof of causality.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 251 Td (- Inspect residuals for nonlinearity, changing variance, outliers, and leakage between training) Tj ET
